<div n="4"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">II.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#fr">Die Regiments-Form.</hi></head><lb/>
<p>1. Die&#x017F;e be&#x017F;tehet in einer gantz ab&#x017F;oluten <hi rendition="#aq">Sou-<lb/>
