<div n="4"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">II.</hi> Der Politi&#x017F;che Zu&#x017F;tand</hi><lb/>
und zwar</head><lb/>
<div n="5"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">I.</hi> Das Regiment.</hi></head><lb/>
